[{"client_msg_id":"5da5b277-ed86-4f9e-b112-0b08452d28b3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ありがとうございます\nタイムアウト値を見てみます","ts":"1637034587.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P7ev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cf02736-8c7e-4c1b-8d19-de3586268a59","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほどお","ts":"1637034580.034400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7zN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"65182506-5870-4942-b933-5b88370cb357","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"コマンドは同期のほうなら確実にされると思いますが。保存時に自動実行のやつは非同期でして。遅いフォーマッター(LSPやエクステンション次第が使ってるツール次第)やファイルが大きい場合はカーソル移動とかでもキャンセルされちゃうかもしれません","ts":"1637030471.034200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"emKa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c8c3e5-f0e2-40b9-a7a2-6a50c6dbd0f7","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"タイムアウトしているのかもしれません。タイムアウトの設定があるので設定値をあげてみると良いかもしれません","ts":"1637030232.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TgMv6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39fd9190-bed2-497b-bcf6-128f465a031a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"していないですね\n:w を何回やってもフォーマットされないです\nコマンドだとちゃんとフォーマットされますが","ts":"1637028723.033200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dee13d2-6c5c-4582-b077-bbad057f0357","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"編集直後にめっちゃ早く保存した場合とかだったりしないです？","ts":"1637028476.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xWI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d00af697-9367-40f1-b909-4063bc4a6e77","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"vimrcの設定は↓になっています\n```  call coc#config('coc.preferences', {\n        \\ 'formatOnSaveFiletypes': [\n          \\ 'go',\n          \\ 'css',\n          \\ 'js',\n          \\ 'javascriptreact',\n          \\ 'ts',\n          \\ 'typescriptreact',\n          \\ 'typescript',\n          \\ 'html',\n          \\ 'scss',\n          \\ 'sass',\n          \\ 'json',\n          \\ 'rust',\n          \\ 'sql',\n          \\ 'bash',\n          \\]})```","ts":"1637028416.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ze2dN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35f57700-6483-4673-83be-70871fa5dafd","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"cocでformatOnSaveFiletypesで保存時にformatを書けるようにしているんですが、たまにそれが動かないことがあります\n原因がさっぱりわからないんですが、同じ事象の方居ますか？","ts":"1637028393.031900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7zT"}]}]
